hortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Director Rose Glass comes an electric new love story; reclusive gym manager Lou falls hard for Jackie, an ambitious bodybuilder headed through town to Vegas.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"violence, gore, drug misuse, sex, domestic abuse, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-11\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":104,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OCYd8Th9ywI\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001078\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001810\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001866\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007400\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007941\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008395\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008396\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008397\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008398\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008399\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008400\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008401\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008402\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008403\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008404\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008405\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008406\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008407\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008408\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008409\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008410\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000033\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00005273\",\"hoCode\":\"A000006547\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Lionsgate\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006033\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Ocean With David Attenborough\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"OCEAN WITH DAVID ATTENBOROUGH takes viewers on a breathtaking journey showing there is nowhere more vital for our survival, more full of life, wonder, or surprise, than the ocean.\\n\\nThe celebrated broadcaster and filmmaker reveals how his lifetime has coincided with the great age of ocean discovery. Through spectacular sequences featuring coral reefs, kelp forests and the open ocean, Attenborough shares why a healthy ocean keeps the entire planet stable and flourishing.\\n\\nStunning, immersive cinematography showcases the wonder of life under the seas and exposes the realities and challenges facing our ocean as never-before-seen, from destructive fishing techniques to mass coral reef bleaching. Yet the story is one of optimism, with Attenborough pointing to inspirational stories from around the world to deliver his greatest message: the ocean can recover to a glory beyond anything anyone alive has ever seen.\\n\\nScreening in cinemas with theatrically exclusive footage.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"David Attenborough takes viewers on a breathtaking journey showing there is nowhere more vital for our survival, more full of life, wonder, or surprise, than the ocean.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"mild upsetting scenes, injury detail\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-08\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":85,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cIZAdCtKT_g\",\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000585\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000586\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000587\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000588\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"77d48b4f-8949-4ff3-aaf8-4bb728f5eb53\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006033\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007440\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Altitude Film Distribution\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006097\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Phoenician Scheme\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"The story of a family and a family business. Starring: Benicio del Toro as Zsa-zsa Korda, one of the richest men in Europe; Mia Threapleton as Liesl, his daughter/a nun; Michael Cera as Bjorn, their tutor. With: Riz Ahmed, Tom Hanks, Bryan Cranston, Mathieu Amalric, Richard Ayoade, Jeffrey Wright, Scarlett Johansson, Benedict Cumberbatch, Rupert Friend, Hope Davis.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The story of a family and a family business. Starring: Benicio del Toro as Zsa-zsa Korda, one of the richest men in Europe.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong injury detail\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":101,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qRAnphZLAIg\",\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000186\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000187\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000698\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001084\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001275\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001395\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001400\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001409\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001410\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001411\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002527\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003325\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005645\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005698\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005699\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011116\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011117\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000003\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"eff6ffca-db00-4c6f-9e5e-1783c6ace2d7\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006097\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007517\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006199\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Hidden (Caché)\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"A married couple is terrorized by a series of surveillance videotapes left on their front porch.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A married couple is terrorized by a series of surveillance videotapes left on their front porch.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-20\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":118,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003240\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004195\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011332\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011334\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011380\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011394\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011412\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"8d52e414-ea56-449f-949a-6cbcfa55a8b7\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006199\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007654\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Curzon\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006204\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Academy Award®-winning director Danny Boyle and Academy Award®-nominated writer Alex Garland reunite for 28 Years Later, a terrifying new story set in the world created by 28 Days Later. It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine, some have found ways to exist amidst the infected. One such group of survivors lives on a small island connected to the mainland by a single, heavily-defended causeway. When one of the group leaves the island on a mission into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine...\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":115,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=poEFz8Ivzug\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000313\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001100\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001270\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003206\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003678\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004531\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010558\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011257\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011418\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011419\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000030\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a7823fd3-66f7-47af-87ba-d36ef45b168c\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006204\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007660\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Sony Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006214\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Last Journey\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Follow Filip Hammar as he takes his dad on a road trip through Europe, down to the Mediterranean, with his best mate Fredrik Wikingsson.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Follow Filip Hammar as he takes his dad on a road trip through Europe, down to the Mediterranean, with his best mate Fredrik Wikingsson.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"mild bad language, upsetting scenes\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-20\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":95,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011475\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011476\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011477\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011478\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011479\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011480\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"37ca7743-bd64-4714-baa3-baf326867eda\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006214\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007670\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Dogwoof\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006110\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"F1® The Movie\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Dubbed “the greatest that never was,” Sonny Hayes (Brad Pitt) was FORMULA 1’s most promising phenom of the 1990s until an accident on the track nearly ended his career. Thirty years later, he’s a nomadic racer-for-hire when he’s approached by his former teammate Ruben Cervantes (Javier Bardem), owner of a struggling FORMULA 1 team that is on the verge of collapse. Ruben convinces Sonny to come back to FORMULA 1 for one last shot at saving the team and being the best in the world. He’ll drive alongside Joshua Pearce (Damson Idris), the team's hotshot rookie intent on setting his own pace. But as the engines roar, Sonny’s past catches up with him and he finds that in FORMULA 1, your teammate is your fiercest competition—and the road to redemption is not something you can travel alone.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Dubbed “the greatest that never was,” Sonny Hayes (Brad Pitt) was FORMULA 1’s most promising phenom of the 1990s until an accident on the track nearly ended his career.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language, moderate threat\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-25\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":156,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TZGY2CWPXeU\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000166\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000167\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001693\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002986\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003190\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003191\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004240\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008544\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008790\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011186\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011187\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011188\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"90334335-0de9-4985-8924-9942f4379b60\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006110\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007538\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Warners\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000001078\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Dave\",\"familyName\":\"Franco\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000001810\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Kristen\",\"familyName\":\"Stewart\",