uristic world, Marvel Studios’ “The Fantastic Four: First Steps” introduces Marvel’s First Family—Reed Richards/Mister Fantastic (Pedro Pascal), Sue Storm/Invisible Woman (Vanessa Kirby), Johnny Storm/Human Torch (Joseph Quinn) and Ben Grimm/The Thing (Ebon Moss-Bachrach) as they face their most daunting challenge yet. Forced to balance their roles as heroes with the strength of their family bond, they must defend Earth from a ravenous space god called Galactus (Ralph Ineson) and his enigmatic Herald, Silver Surfer (Julia Garner). And if Galactus’ plan to devour the entire planet and everyone on it weren’t bad enough, it suddenly gets very personal. The action adventure also stars Paul Walter Hauser, John Malkovich, Natasha Lyonne and Sarah Niles.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Set against the vibrant backdrop of a 1960s-inspired, retro-futuristic world, Marvel Studios’ “The Fantastic Four: First Steps” introduces Marvel’s First Family.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"VS00000007\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-07-25\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":130,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eW3Q8N42Bm0\",\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000267\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000708\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000802\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001227\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002970\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007262\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008478\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009722\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000581\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000582\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000583\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000007\",\"0000000035\",\"0000000036\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"970b06cc-4a61-4cd0-a256-565df86e1f40\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00005983\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007383\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures - UK\"},{\"id\":\"HO00001704\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Film Club: Happy End\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Master auteur Michael Haneke (Amour, The White Ribbon, Hidden) returns with a biting satire on bourgeois family values set in the shadow of the European refugee crisis. Featuring a cast of top acting talent, including Isabelle Huppert, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Mathieu Kassovitz and Toby Jones, it’s a piercing dark comedy on the blind preoccupations of middle-class angst.\\n\\nWhen her mother falls ill under mysterious circumstances, young Eve (Fantine Harduin) is sent to live with her estranged father’s relatives in Calais. The Laurent family – wealthy, neurotic and self-obsessed – own a lucrative construction company and live in a sprawling mansion house, waited on by servants. But trouble is brewing, as a series of intergenerational back-stabbings threaten to tear the family apart. Meanwhile, distracted by infidelities and betrayals, they fail to notice that their new arrival has a sinister secret of her own.\\n\\nNominated for the Palme d’Or at the 2017 Cannes Film Festival, Happy End bears all the hallmarks of Haneke’s uniquely stark and unsympathetic style. Pairing pitch-black humour with chillingly precise direction, it’s proof – if we ever needed it – that he remains one of modern cinema’s true visionaries.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A drama about a family set in Calais with the European refugee crisis as the backdrop.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong sex references, suicide references, language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-08-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":108,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_n_yk2AT7w\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000258\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000491\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002163\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010826\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011334\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011335\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011336\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00001704\",\"hoCode\":\"A000002184\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Curzon\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000000267\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Paul Walter\",\"familyName\":\"Hauser\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000000708\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Kevin\",\"familyName\":\"Feige\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000000802\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Vanessa\",\"familyName\":\"Kirby\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000001227\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Ralph\",\"familyName\":\"Ineson\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000002970\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Pedro\",\"familyName\":\"Pascal\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000003576\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Natasha \",\"familyName\":\"Lyonne\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000007262\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Julia\",\"familyName\":\"Garner\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000008478\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Joseph\",\"familyName\":\"Quinn\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000009722\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"John\",\"familyName\":\"Malkovich\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00000581\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Ebon\",\"familyName\":\"Moss-Bachrach\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00000582\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Sarah\",\"familyName\":\"Niles\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00000583\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Matt\",\"familyName\":\"Shak