Paul Walter Hauser, John Malkovich, Natasha Lyonne and Sarah Niles.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Set against the vibrant backdrop of a 1960s-inspired, retro-futuristic world, Marvel Studios’ “The Fantastic Four: First Steps” introduces Marvel’s First Family.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"VS00000007\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-07-25\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":130,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eW3Q8N42Bm0\",\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000267\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000708\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000802\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001227\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002970\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007262\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008478\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009722\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000581\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000582\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000583\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000007\",\"0000000035\",\"0000000036\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"970b06cc-4a61-4cd0-a256-565df86e1f40\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00005983\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007383\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures - UK\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000000267\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Paul Walter\",\"familyName\":\"Hauser\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000000708\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Kevin\",\"familyName\":\"Feige\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000000802\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Vanessa\",\"familyName\":\"Kirby\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000001227\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Ralph\",\"familyName\":\"I